direction: down

ask: Ask ChatGPT to design a form
internal: ChatGPT opens its internal WebMCP tab
tools: Agent reads and edits with WebMCP tools
handoff: create_live_handoff mints a fresh link (start_pairing mints one too)
open: Open the link in another browser
valid: Is the token valid and unused? {
  shape: diamond
}
claim: Join the live session and remove the token from the URL
support: Does the new browser expose WebMCP? {
  shape: diamond
}
both: WebMCP tools available + live sync
sync: Complete visual editor + live sync
copy: Open a safe, independent design copy
fresh: Ask ChatGPT for a fresh live link

ask -> internal -> tools
tools -> handoff: After the final edit
handoff -> open -> valid
valid -> claim: Yes
claim -> support
support -> both: Yes
support -> sync: No
valid -> copy: Expired or already used
copy -> fresh: Need live continuation
fresh -> handoff

*.style.border-radius: 12
ask.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
ask.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
internal.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
internal.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
tools.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
tools.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
handoff.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
handoff.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
open.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
open.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
valid.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
valid.style.stroke: "#d97706"
claim.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
claim.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
support.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
support.style.stroke: "#d97706"
both.style.fill: "#d1fae5"
both.style.stroke: "#059669"
sync.style.fill: "#d1fae5"
sync.style.stroke: "#059669"
copy.style.fill: "#f5f5f4"
copy.style.stroke: "#78716c"
fresh.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
fresh.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
